1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,800
Talabamisiz? Ish, turar joy va bepul kurslar — endi bir joyda!

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,600
Telegram’da TalabaGo botini oching va bir bosishda ilovaga kiring.

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:14,700
Talaba sifatida ro‘yxatdan o‘tish bir daqiqa ham olmaydi.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:21,900
“Ishlar” bo‘limida o‘qishingizga mos ishni toping: soatlik, kunlik yoki doimiy.

5
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:29,600
Filtrlang, e’lonni oching va arizani bir zumda yuboring.

6
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:36,300
“Turar joy” bo‘limida talabalarga mos uy va xonalarni ko‘ring.

7
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:42,600
Rasmlar, narx va qulayliklarni ko‘rib, ijara so‘rovini yuboring.

8
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:48,900
“Kurslar” bo‘limida rus va ingliz tilini bepul o‘rganing.

9
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:54,600
Video, lug‘at va test — har bir dars progressingizga qo‘shiladi.

10
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:59,900
“Arizalarim” bo‘limida barcha arizalaringiz holatini kuzating.

11
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:04,600
Suhbatga taklif yoki javob kelsa — darhol bilasiz.

12
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:09,800
TalabaGo — talabalar uchun imkoniyatlar platformasi.

13
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:14,600
Telegram’da @talaba_2026_go_bot ni oching — hoziroq boshlang!
